1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,760
In this video we're going to take a look at how an extension can be applied to one or more sites

2
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:16,240
once it has been added to your library. To apply an extension to a new site, from the sites page

3
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:25,240
select new site. Under scan settings select the extensions tab and from the drop down menu select

4
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:31,480
one or more extensions to apply to the site. When you've selected all the extensions you need and

5
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:41,160
filled in the other details for your new site click save. For existing sites the process is very similar.

6
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:50,440
From the sites page choose the appropriate site. From the details tab click edit and under scan

7
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:57,480
settings select the extensions tab. When you've selected all the extensions you need click save.

8
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:12,600
To remove an extension from a site again from the sites page find the site and on the details tab

9
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:29,320
click edit. Under scan settings select the extensions tab, click the trash icon and click save.

